From your command line, run:

docker build -f Dockerfile_base --progress=plain -t valitext_base .
docker build -f Dockerfile --progress=plain -t valitext:latest .

Then, to push on heroku:

heroku container:login
heroku create valitext-2-0
heroku container:push web --app valitext-2-0
heroku container:release web --app valitext-2-0
heroku open --app valitext-2-0

> Be sure to have the heroku CLI installed.
> You can replace ValiText-1-0 with another app name.
